    },
    "Start rove-bridge on your Mac, then scan the QR code it shows or paste the link it prints." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Mac 上启动 rove-bridge，然后扫描它显示的二维码，或粘贴它打印的链接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stories start in the backlog. Start a session from one when it is time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Story 从待办开始。时机到了再从中启动会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switches %@ off: its actions and events stop running on the mac. It stays installed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭 %@：其 actions 和 events 在 Mac 上停止运行。仍保持已安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switches %@ off: the TUI stops offering it and new tasks stop defaulting to it. Its settings stay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭 %@：TUI 不再提供它，新任务不再默认使用它。其设置保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switches %@ off: the TUI stops offering it and new tasks stop defaulting to it. Its settings stay. It is the default, so another enabled engine takes over as default." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭 %@：TUI 不再提供它，新任务不再默认使用它。其设置保留。它当前是默认引擎，将由另一个已开启的引擎接任默认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switches %@ on: its actions and events run again on the mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启 %@：其 actions 和 events 在 Mac 上恢复运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switches %@ on: the TUI offers it again and new tasks can default to it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启 %@：TUI 重新提供它，新任务可默认使用它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tabs share the worktree but keep their own process, scrollback and conversation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "标签页共用 worktree，但各自保留进程、回滚内容和对话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Takes effect the next time the session is rebuilt. A tab that is running keeps its current engine until then." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下次重建会话时生效。在此之前，正在运行的标签页仍使用当前引擎。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminal mode" : {
